    "Our facilities integrate long-stay lodging for corporate teams and groups (14 rooms for 28 to 80 guests), gala tents and lawns for macro-events and weddings, alongside a heated pool, restaurant, and sports facilities as value-added amenities.": "我们的设施集成了适合企业团队与团体的长期住宿（14间客房，容纳28至80位宾客）、适宜大型活动与婚礼的礼堂帐篷及草坪花园，并配备温水泳池、餐厅及多功能运动场等高品质附加设施。",
    "Our facilities integrate long-stay lodging for up to 65 guests (14 internal baths, 7 double & 59 single beds), 13,000 m² lawns, 8 external restrooms, and 80–100 parking spots alongside an 84 m² pool (70 pax), restaurant, and sports courts.": "我们的庄园集长租住宿（最多65人 · 14间室内卫浴、7张双人床及59张单人床）、13,000平方米花园、8间户外卫生间、80–100个车位以及84平方米泳池（70人）、餐厅与运动场于一体。",
    "Our international delegation stayed the entire week in Píntag. The heated pool, on-site dining, and outdoor sports courts were the perfect complement after intense field days.": "我们的外派代表团在平塔格庄园整整住了一周。恒温泳池、自营餐厅及运动场地成为繁忙野外作业后最惬意的放松天地。",
