    "Warm hardwood suite for corporate leaders, NGO directors, or long-stay travelers. Features en-suite bathroom, work desk with fiber Wi-Fi, TV, secure parking, and access to dining room and heated pool.": "温馨典雅的名贵硬木行政套房，专为企业高管、国际NGO负责人或深度考察贵宾打造。配备独立卫浴、光纤办公书桌、智能电视、专属车位，并可自由前往餐厅与恒温泳池。",
