    "We Turn Your Dream Wedding Into an Everlasting Story ♡": "将您的梦中婚礼，淬炼为历久弥新的浪漫传奇 ♡",
    "We are at your disposal to coordinate property visits, answer questions, or craft a personalized proposal for your event or stay.": "我们随时恭候为您安排庄园实地参观考察、解答各类咨询，或为您的团队活动及住宿量身定制专属方案。",
    "We believe every love story is unique, and so should every wedding be. At Hacienda Le Plus we combine creativity, Andean nature, signature gastronomy, and flawless execution with our dedicated in-house team to craft elegant, intimate, and unforgettable celebrations in Píntag.": "我们坚信每一段爱情故事皆独一无二，婚礼亦当如此。在 Hacienda Le Plus，我们汇聚创意灵感、安第斯壮阔自然、庄园主厨珍馐与专属团队的默契执行，为您在平塔格倾心缔造典雅、私密而终生难忘的婚礼庆典。",
    "We booked the room wing for our guests and organizing crew. Spacious, 24/7 security, and transparent volume and duration quoting.": "我们为团队宾客和会务组包下了整栋客房楼。环境开阔幽静，24小时安保严格，报价体系非常透明合理。",
    "We celebrate exclusive weddings and social gatherings across 13,000 m² of gardens with 8 external restrooms, 80–100 parking spots, gala marquee tent, in-house catering, bespoke decor, and": "我们在13,000平方米花园举办专属婚礼与高端社交宴会，配8间户外卫生间、80–100个车位、大型礼堂篷房、自营餐饮、定制花艺布置及",
    "We celebrate exclusive weddings and social gatherings with ceremonial gardens, gala marquee tent, in-house catering, bespoke decor, and": "我们举办专属尊享婚礼与社交庆典，配备仪式花园、宴会大厅帐篷、专属自营餐饮、定制主题装饰以及",
    "We celebrate exclusive weddings and social gatherings with ceremonial gardens, gala marquee tent, in-house catering, bespoke decor, and 14 rooms (28 to 80 guests), strengthened by our heated pool, restaurant, and recreation grounds.": "我们举办专属尊享婚礼与社交庆典，配备仪式花园、宴会大厅帐篷、专属自营餐饮、定制主题装饰以及 14 间客房（容纳 28 至 80 位宾客），并配有恒温泳池、餐厅及多功能休闲区作为增值配套。",
    "We design tailored proposals for corporate staff, delegations, NGOs, volunteers, and international groups. Choose your guest range (from 1 up to 65 guests with 14 internal bathrooms, 7 double + 59 single beds) and stay duration (days, weeks, or months) with catering, fiber-optic internet, and 80–100 parking spaces.": "我们为企业人员、代表团、非政府组织、志愿者及国际团队提供定制方案。可根据实际人数（1至65人，配14间室内卫浴、7张双人床 + 59张单人床）及租期（按天、按周或按月）灵活搭配餐饮、光纤Wi-Fi和80–100个车位。",
    "We design tailored proposals for corporate staff, delegations, NGOs, volunteers, and international groups. Choose your guest range (from 1 up to 80 guests in 14 rooms) and duration (by days, weeks, or months) with catering, fiber-optic internet, and private parking.": "为企业团队、外派代表团、国际NGO、志愿者和涉外团体设计量身定制的方案。可自由选择团队人数（14间客房，支持1至80人）及住宿周期（按天、按周或按月），全面包含膳食配餐、高速光纤网络与专属安全停车。",
    "We held our ceremony and reception across 13,000 m² of gardens and accommodated our guests in the suites and family house.": "我们在13,000平方米花园中举办了婚礼仪式与晚宴，并将亲友安排在套房和家庭别墅入住。",
    "We held our ceremony and reception in the gardens and accommodated all our out-of-town guests in the 14 on-site rooms.": "我们在花园草坪中举办了庄重浪漫的仪式与婚宴，并将远道而来的所有亲朋好友妥善安排在庄园的14间独立客房中。",
    "We hosted our international HXP mission of 42 volunteers with full comfort. The 3-course meal plan, fiber-optic internet, and 80–100 private parking spaces for our buses performed flawlessly.": "我们舒适地接待了由42名志愿者组成的国际HXP代表团。一日三餐膳食、高速光纤网络以及可容纳大巴的80–100个专用车位运行得非常完美。",
    "We lodged our international HXP mission of 42 volunteers across the 14 rooms. The 3-course catering, dedicated fiber optic WiFi, and bus parking operated seamlessly.": "我们42名国际HXP志愿者团队入住了庄园的14间客房。一日三餐按时供应，专享光纤网络高速稳定，大巴停车与后勤调度无可挑剔。",
    "We lodged our international HXP mission of 42 volunteers with full comfort. The 3-course catering, dedicated fiber optic WiFi, and bus parking operated seamlessly.": "我们的42人HXP国际志愿团队在此住得十分舒心。一日三餐餐饮、专线光纤Wi-Fi以及大巴停车区运作无可挑剔。",
    "We offer much more than scenic gardens in Píntag. We craft complete wedding journeys marking the beginning of your new life together, featuring signature dining, luxury lodging, and an experienced team beside you at every step.": "我们呈献的远不止平塔格的如画花园。我们精心雕琢见证您二人新生活起航的全流程婚礼体验，汇聚主厨匠心盛宴、庄园奢华客房，以及全程相伴的资深会务团队。",
    "We streamline accommodation logistics for corporate teams, delegations, NGOs, volunteers, and international groups with clear volume and duration rates.": "为企业驻派团队、外派代表团、国际NGO、志愿者和涉外团体简化住宿后勤统筹，提供基于人数与租期的透明阶梯报价。",
    "We support every wedding, corporate retreat, and international delegation in Píntag to ensure a memorable, warm, and well-coordinated experience.": "我们悉心护航在平塔格举办的每一场浪漫婚礼、企业研讨峰会与涉外代表团下榻，确保每一刻体验都温馨难忘、细致周到。",
