    "Year-end galas, team building retreats, conventions, and large-format corporate gatherings in Quito–Píntag. Features structural tents, 5,000 m² lawns, in-house catering, stage, dance floor, sports courts, pool, and complementary lodging.": "基多–平塔格大型年会盛典、团队拓展、商务峰会与大型招待会。配备专业结构大篷、5000平方米观景草坪、高品质定制餐饮、专业舞台音响、舞池、多功能球场、恒温泳池及现场客房配套。",
    "Year-end galas, team building, and conventions across 13,000 m² of gardens with 8 external restrooms, 80–100 parking spaces, structural tents, stage, dance floor, sports courts, and 84 m² pool. Social hall for events/coaching, 50-pax nightclub & karaoke at an extra fee.": "可在13,000平方米花园举办企业年会、团建与大会，配备8间户外卫生间、80–100个车位、大型篷房、舞台、舞池、运动场及84平方米泳池。活动/培训社交大厅、50人迪斯科及卡拉OK为额外收费项目。",
    "Year-end galas, team integration, conventions, and large-format celebrations (up to 400 pax) with in-house catering, dance floor, sports, pool, and lodging.": "满足多达400人规模的年终盛典、团队熔炼拓展与大型商务峰会，配备自营高端餐饮、舞池、运动场、恒温泳池与住宿。",
    "Year-end galas, team integration, conventions, and large-format celebrations in Quito–Píntag. Featuring 13,000 m² gardens, 8 external restrooms, 80–100 parking spaces, structural tents, in-house catering, stage, sports courts (7v7 soccer, pro basketball, volleyball), 84 m² pool (70 pax), and lodging up to 65 guests.": "在基多–平塔格举办企业年会、团建拓展、学术峰会及大型庆典。提供13,000平方米花园、8间户外卫生间、80–100个车位、大型结构篷房、自营餐饮、舞台、运动场（7v7足球、专业篮球、排球）、84平方米泳池（70人）及最多65人住宿。",
    "Year-end galas, team integration, conventions, and large-format celebrations in Quito–Píntag. Featuring structural tents, landscaped gardens, in-house catering, stage, and dance floor, complemented by sports facilities, heated pool, and on-site lodging.": "年终盛典、团队建设、行业年会与大型企业盛会尽在基多–平塔格。配备专业礼堂帐篷、典雅花园、自营高品质餐饮、演艺舞台与专业舞池，并配有多功能体育设施、温水泳池与现场配套客房住宿。",
    "Year-end galas, team integration, conventions, and large-format celebrations with tents, gardens, catering, stage, dance floor, sports, pool, and lodging.": "承接年终庆典、团队建设、行业年会与大型峰会，配备篷房、草坪、自营餐饮、专业舞台、舞池、运动场、恒温泳池及住宿保障。",
    "Year-end galas, team integration, conventions, and large-format events across 13,000 m² gardens with 8 external restrooms, 80–100 parking spots, sports courts, 84 m² pool, and optional extra-fee social hall (events/coaching), 50-pax nightclub & karaoke.": "在13,000平方米花园举办企业年会、团建拓展与大会，配8间户外卫生间、80–100个车位、运动场地、84平方米泳池，以及额外收费的活动培训社交大厅、50人迪斯科与卡拉OK。",
    "Year-end, team retreats & conventions: 13,000 m² gardens, 8 ext. restrooms, catering, stage & sports.": "年会、团建与大会：13,000平方米花园、8间户外卫生间、自营餐饮、舞台及运动场。",
    "Year-end, team retreats & conventions: tents, gardens, catering, stage, dance floor & pool.": "年会庆典、团队拓展与会议：豪华大篷、花园、定制餐饮、舞台、舞池、运动场与泳池。",
    "Year-end, team retreats, conventions, gala marquee, lawns, stage, dance floor, sports & pool.": "年会、团建、会议、豪华大篷、草坪、舞台、舞池、运动场与泳池一应俱全。",
